reports more than 750,000 to over one million robots across its fulfillment network, including
drive units, mobile manipulators, and next-generation platforms such as Pegasus and Xanthus
[13, 14]. These fleets demonstrate reliable fleet management, safe human–robot collaboration,
and 24/7 uptime in highly dynamic environments.
