reminders to improve treatment adherence [28]. These studies confirm that a robot’s ability
to interact socially is a powerful tool for improving patient well-being and clinical outcomes.
The primary limitation of SARs, however, is that they are typically specialized, non-mobile or
semi-autonomous platforms that lack the high-fidelity telepresence capabilities needed for direct
clinical consultation.
